, we substitute the coordinate expressions of $r(u,v)$ into $f(x,y,z):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(r(u,v)) & =(-x-y-z)\\,{|}_{x=u\\,y={v}^{2}-{u}^{2}\\,z=u} \\\\  & =-u-({v}^{2}-{u}^{2})-u \\\\  & ={u}^{2}-{v}^{2}-2u\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface integral can be written as \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}f(r(u,v))‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\,({u}^{2}-{v}^{2}-2u)\\sqrt{8}v\\,\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535474 true] [17592186351079 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351080 13194139535474 true] [17592186351079 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351081 13194139535474 true] [17592186351079 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351082 13194139535474 true] [17592186351079 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351083 13194139535474 true] [17592186351079 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351084 13194139535474 true] [17592186351079 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535474 true] [17592186351079 1041 "selection" 13194139535474 true] [17592186351079 1104 #edb/ref 17592186351080 13194139535474 true] [17592186351079 1110 #uuid "b2809c52-243d-56a4-937d-e75412acf949" 13194139535474 true] [17592186351080 1034 "({u}^{2}-{v}^{2}-2u)\\sqrt{8}v" 13194139535474 true] [17592186351080 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535474 true] [17592186351080 1111 #uuid "4518e3d7-a24f-5ca6-a02e-940fc55f5343" 13194139535474 true] [17592186351081 1034 "({u}^{2}-{v}^{2})\\sqrt{8}u" 13194139535474 true] [17592186351081 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535474 true] [17592186351081 1111 #uuid "e2069f29-4d51-5f60-a9dd-fafb3f575ee1" 13194139535474 true] [17592186351082 1034 "({u}^{2}+{v}^{2}+u)\\sqrt{8v}" 13194139535474 true] [17592186351082 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535474 true] [17592186351082 1111 #uuid "33a00a0e-ab3b-5331-9800-ea0eae6e2581" 13194139535474 true] [17592186351083 1034 "({v}^{2}-{u}^{2}-2)\\sqrt{8}" 13194139535474 true] [17592186351083 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535474 true] [17592186351083 1111 #uuid "16a98401-3809-5ca7-b405-9897bc9b31cb" 1319