,2{v}^{2},\\,u⟩‖ \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(2v)^{2}+(2{v}^{2})^{2}+(u)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4{v}^{2}+4{v}^{4}+{u}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute the coordinate expressions of $r(u,v)$ into $f(x,y,z):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(r(u,v)) & =(x-{y}^{2}z)\\,{|}_{x=uv\\,y=-u\\,z=-{v}^{2}} \\\\  & =uv-(-u)^{2}\\cdot -{v}^{2} \\\\  & =uv+{u}^{2}{v}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface integral can be written as \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}f(r(u,v))‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\,(uv+{u}^{2}{v}^{2})\\sqrt{4{v}^{2}+4{v}^{4}+{u}^{2}}\\,\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535474 true] [17592186351086 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351087 13194139535474 true] [17592186351086 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351088 13194139535474 true] [17592186351086 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351089 13194139535474 true] [17592186351086 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351090 13194139535474 true] [17592186351086 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351091 13194139535474 true] [17592186351086 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535474 true] [17592186351086 1041 "selection" 13194139535474 true] [17592186351086 1104 #edb/ref 17592186351090 13194139535474 true] [17592186351086 1110 #uuid "c36c6317-cb93-593c-bd50-be329034a767" 13194139535474 true] [17592186351087 1034 "(uv+uv)\\sqrt{2{v}^{2}+4{v}^{4}-{u}^{2}}" 13194139535474 true] [17592186351087 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535474 true] [17592186351087 1111 #uuid "0916d5f8-0fe0-513a-ae34-774abafb0c10" 13194139535474 true] [17592186351088 1034 "(uv+u{v}^{2})\\sqrt{4{v}^{2}+{v}^{2}+{v}^{2}{u}^{2}}" 13194139535474 true] [17592186351088 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535474 true] [17592186351088 1111 #uuid "e8d2c65c-3804-5909-bd87-dca5f06014fc" 13194139535474 true] [17592186351089 1034 "(u+{u}^{2}{v}^{2})\\sqrt{{v}^{2}-4{v}^{4}-{u}^{2}}" 13194139535474 true] [17592186351089 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535474 true] [17592186351089 1111 #uuid "efe80158-a835-5c3d-a1e4-bfab0b122041" 13194139535474 